# Kiwi: every MIDI source feeds Midi Through; the audio host reads only Midi Through.
.hw --> Midi Through
rtpmidid --> Midi Through
Midi Through -x-> Midi Through
# The web UI's MIDI monitor (aseqdump, started without -p) is connected here, so
# amidiminder is the only one making that connection.
Midi Through --> aseqdump
